Yup. gray stones should never remain unidentified more than about five
turns.

1. Kick it. "Thump" equals loadstone - don't pick it up!
2. Name it as "Heart of ahriman". If your finger slips, it's a
luckstone.
2. Rub it against something metal. "scritch scritch" equals touchstone.
3. Otherwise it's flint.

